cite-scope\">4.8.21</span> </span> ). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">let go, let alone, leave</b> one, of an illness, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Coac.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">564</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">discharge, disband</b> an army, <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. οἴκαδε</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.5.21</span> </span>; generally, <b class=\"lex-tr\">dismiss, discharge,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἐμὲ.. ἀπέλυς' ἄδειπνον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ach.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1155</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Bion</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.96</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">divorce</b> a wife, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ev.Matt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.19</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">τὸν ἄνδρα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.S.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.18</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">do away with, remove,</b> <span class=\"gk\">αἰσχύνην</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">20.47</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.1.5</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\"